srem9: x % 9, for x from -999 to 999, with the sign of x. Inline: no call.
Listed at cells 10-19, with x in cell 90.
Copy cells 10-19 to where the program needs x % 9, with each 90 changed to the program's cell for x; the program goes on with x % 9 in the accumulator.
It overwrites the accumulator; x is kept.
Size 10 cells. It runs 10 instructions, straight through.
Exact over the domain.

cell  contents   notes
 10     190      CLA 90   cells 10-18: 1111x modulo 10^4, whose thousands digit is the remainder; ADD x, SUB x mends remainder 0 through the accumulator's wrap
 11     410      SFT 10
 12     290      ADD 90
 13     410      SFT 10
 14     290      ADD 90
 15     410      SFT 10
 16     290      ADD 90
 17     290      ADD 90
 18     790      SUB 90
 19     403      SFT 03   cell 19: the thousands digit
 90     000      data: x, the program's cell, which is kept
